Content/Vge/Imported/
Content/UI/
Content/JavaScript/vge/game.js
# Base release metadata, written by BuildCookRun -createreleaseversion
Releases/
# This machine's engine location, written by `npm run setup`
vge.config.json
# Unreal's stock Mannequin, copied from the engine's Third Person template resources (see README)
Content/Characters/Mannequins/
# Plugins installed from Fab (dev/content/fab.mjs): licensed to the user. The runtime key still counts them
# (dev/tools/runtime.mjs sourceFiles). Asset packs and model files from Fab carry a .gitignore of their own.
